      "id": "claim_1b9c68f82ea74281927602a254784bac",
      "statement": "`open_tab` opens a new browser tab at an HTTP/HTTPS URL via `tabs.create({ url })` and returns the new `tabId`, `url`, and `title` without waiting for the page to fully load; non-http(s) schemes return `unsupported_scheme`.",
