      "statement": "Chrome and Safari both implement `PageOpenTabAdapter.openTab` using the standard WebExtensions `tabs.create({ url })` API and return the new tab ID as a string, giving full browser parity; if no `PageOpenTabAdapter` is provided the background controller responds with `not_supported`.",
