    {
      "id": "claim_647009c1b9864991ae9cc03f21acaef0",
      "statement": "`capture_screenshot` captures a viewport-only JPEG (quality 80) of the active tab via `tabs.captureVisibleTab`; the `tabId` parameter exists for forward compatibility but P3.3 validates it matches the active tab, so to screenshot a specific tab the agent must `open_tab` to create a dedicated tab first.",
